Project Planning – Educational Management System

Objective: Plan tasks, resources, and timeline for smooth project execution.

1. Define Scope:
	•	Admissions, student tracking, staff management, workflow automation, reports.

2. Identify Tasks:
	•	Requirement analysis → Design → Development → Testing → Deployment → Documentation

3. Assign Roles:
	•	Team members assigned to modules and tasks.

4. Set Timeline:
	•	Allocate start and end dates for each task.

5. Resources Needed:
	•	ServiceNow, database, coding tools, test data, UI mockups

6. Risk Assessment:
	•	Identify challenges like data security, workflow errors, and system performance.

7. Monitoring & Review:
	•	Track progress and adjust plan as needed.
